    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Tech Store Simulator&quot;</strong> is an engaging first-person simulation where every aspect of running an electronic shop comes to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your store</strong>, optimizing for both efficiency and aesthetics. Determine the best display for your tech gadgets, manage your aisles, and ensure a seamless shopping experience for your customers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/ab474119c6b3c1348b69c75662197d65.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/ab474119c6b3c1348b69c75662197d65.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/ab474119c6b3c1348b69c75662197d65.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Order stock using an in-game computer</strong>. Unpack the latest tech gadgets, organize them in your storage room, and strategically place them on shelves and displays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/5f3f87d9fe2fe3c2898ee32ae8eb2cb2.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/5f3f87d9fe2fe3c2898ee32ae8eb2cb2.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/5f3f87d9fe2fe3c2898ee32ae8eb2cb2.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Handle customer</strong> transactions by scanning items and making sure customers leave satisfied with their shopping and checkout experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/7b09e74c934bf170e0e36686ad7bc25e.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/7b09e74c934bf170e0e36686ad7bc25e.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/7b09e74c934bf170e0e36686ad7bc25e.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Be careful of thieves.</strong>\u00a0Not all clients want you to make money. Some of them just want to pick up and run. In this case, only a magic kick will help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/2586684e305017854a4d81be142b75bc.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/2586684e305017854a4d81be142b75bc.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/2586684e305017854a4d81be142b75bc.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customers come in many forms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some clients will be nice to you, some not so nice, but you should be able to capitalize on all situations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/48b62e3c962bfb2d74fab11819cee619.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/48b62e3c962bfb2d74fab11819cee619.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/48b62e3c962bfb2d74fab11819cee619.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &quot;Tech Store Simulator&quot;, every decision matters.</strong> Will you rise to the occasion, transforming a modest tech store into a retail powerhouse, while balancing customer satisfaction and finances?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Tech Store Simulator&quot;</strong> is an engaging first-person simulation where every aspect of running an electronic shop comes to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your store</strong>, optimizing for both efficiency and aesthetics. Determine the best display for your tech gadgets, manage your aisles, and ensure a seamless shopping experience for your customers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/ab474119c6b3c1348b69c75662197d65.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/ab474119c6b3c1348b69c75662197d65.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/ab474119c6b3c1348b69c75662197d65.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Order stock using an in-game computer</strong>. Unpack the latest tech gadgets, organize them in your storage room, and strategically place them on shelves and displays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/5f3f87d9fe2fe3c2898ee32ae8eb2cb2.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/5f3f87d9fe2fe3c2898ee32ae8eb2cb2.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/5f3f87d9fe2fe3c2898ee32ae8eb2cb2.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Handle customer</strong> transactions by scanning items and making sure customers leave satisfied with their shopping and checkout experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/7b09e74c934bf170e0e36686ad7bc25e.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/7b09e74c934bf170e0e36686ad7bc25e.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/7b09e74c934bf170e0e36686ad7bc25e.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Be careful of thieves.</strong>\u00a0Not all clients want you to make money. Some of them just want to pick up and run. In this case, only a magic kick will help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/2586684e305017854a4d81be142b75bc.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/2586684e305017854a4d81be142b75bc.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/2586684e305017854a4d81be142b75bc.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customers come in many forms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some clients will be nice to you, some not so nice, but you should be able to capitalize on all situations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/48b62e3c962bfb2d74fab11819cee619.poster.avif?t=1738220533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/48b62e3c962bfb2d74fab11819cee619.webm?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076400/extras/48b62e3c962bfb2d74fab11819cee619.mp4?t=1738220533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &quot;Tech Store Simulator&quot;, every decision matters.</strong> Will you rise to the occasion, transforming a modest tech store into a retail powerhouse, while balancing customer satisfaction and finances?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Tech Store Simulator is a game in which you have to build your own tech store. Buy goods, put them on the shelves, sell them at an inflated price and beat the thieves!Also in the game there is a huge number of opportunities to customize the store and make it the way you would like it in life",
